FAA has determined that the operators of 652 aircraft were affected. Of those 652 aircraft, only two remaining aircraft need to incorporate SB 304-25-24, which are scheduled for completion by October 2007. 
Based on the following information, the FAA has determined that there is minimal risk associated with these outstanding aircraft. 
